  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まさか優勝するとはな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You actually won the whole thing?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>勝利の証として、
これを汝にさしあげよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As proof of your victory,
we present you with this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>次は別のメンバーでも
出場してみてはどうだろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How about trying again with
a different party member?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>残念だったな。
だが、それがおまえの
実力ということだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's too bad.
But, that's the real
limit of your ability.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、また来るがいい。
我々は強き者ならば、
戦いたい者を拒みはしない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You should come again, though.
We don't turn away anyone
who's strong and wants to fight.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
